// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1566845867" "I take it you're familiar with Crey Technologies? They've been doing some fascinating work with all manner of body augmentations, from bio-genetic chemical regrowth to nanotech hyper-musculature hyper-indexing. All in all, they've produced some amazing results! AeonCorp has spoken with Crey regarding a merger of some persuasion, but Countess Crey always seems to want far more than she is willing to give.<br><br>We need to take more... <i>creative measures</i> in order to secure these technologies for ourselves. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Crey Industries lab in Paragon City and steal what you can!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P599785223" "Steal Crey secrets"
// SendOffString :
"P2791624752" "There's a boat waiting at the docks to take you to Paragon City."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3195208820" "Don't be long! I can't wait to delve into all the new toys Crey has built!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1417367304" "You make your way to the Crey offices in Paragon City. Steal all the Crey tech available!"

