// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1352153763" "I don't know how to put this delicately, so I'll just say it: one of the Aeon scientific experiments has gone awry! Yes, I know it's hard to believe this coming from the AeonCorp, but occasionally even the most brilliant of scientists can make a mistake! In this case, it had to do with experimentation into transdimensional high-energy sources. The theory is quite interesting, as it deals with using transdimensional sources to power the energy conduits necessary to maintain the dimensional vortex in place... but never mind that! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We need you to shut down the experiment BEFORE IT DESTROYS THE WORLD!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P64798042" "Shut down experiment"
// SendOffString :
"P492324238" "Well, perhaps it wouldn't destroy the world, but it might destroy our lab, and there's some VERY expensive equipment in there!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1890275145" "What are you waiting for? Scoot! Scoot! Clear the transdimensional infestation out of the tech lab!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P944362654" "The air in the lab seems highly ionized!"

